Handling errors in this SDK should largely match your expectations. All operations return a response object or an error, they will never return both.

By Default, an API error will return `{{templateDefaultError true}}`. When custom error responses are specified for an operation, the SDK may also return their associated error. You can refer to respective *Errors* tables in SDK docs for more details on possible error types for each operation.

